---
import Container from "@components/Container.astro";
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "@consts";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Legal & Privacy"
  description="Legal Notice and Privacy Policy"
>
  <Container>
    <div class="space-y-10 animate">
      <section>
        <h1 class="page-title mb-6">Legal Notice (Impressum)</h1>
        <div
          class="space-y-4 text-sm text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed"
        >
          <p>
            Information provided according to § 5 Digitale-Dienste-Gesetz (DDG):
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>David Woitzik</strong><br />
            Fritz-Räcke-Straße 8<br />
            50354 Hürth<br />
            Germany
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Represented by:</strong><br />
            David Woitzik
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Contact:</strong><br />
            Email: <a
              href={`mailto:${SITE.EMAIL}`}
              class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600">{SITE.EMAIL}</a
            >
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>VAT ID:</strong><br />
            VAT identification number pursuant to § 27a of the German Value Added
            Tax Act (UStG):<br />
            DE462011953
          </p>
          <p>
            <em>
              Kleinunternehmer gemäß § 19 Abs. 1 UStG: no VAT is charged.
            </em>
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Consumer Dispute Resolution:</strong><br />
            We are not willing or obliged to participate in dispute resolution proceedings
            before a consumer arbitration board.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800" />

      <section>
        <h2
          class="text-2xl font-black text-black dark:text-white tracking-tighter mb-4"
        >
          Privacy Policy (Datenschutz)
        </h2>
        <div
          class="space-y-4 text-sm text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed"
        >
          <p>
            <strong>1. General Overview</strong><br />
            I take the protection of your personal data very seriously. I treat your
            personal data confidentially and in accordance with the statutory data
            protection regulations (GDPR). The use of this website is generally possible
            without providing personal data.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>2. Hosting and Log Files</strong><br />
            This site is hosted on <strong>Vercel Inc.</strong>, 340 Pine
            Street, Suite 701, San Francisco, CA 94104, USA. The provider
            automatically collects and stores information in server log files
            which your browser transmits automatically. These are: browser type
            and version, operating system used, referrer URL, hostname of the
            accessing computer, and time of the server request. This data is not
            merged with other data sources. For details, see <a
              href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy"
              class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Vercel's privacy policy</a
            >.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>3. Cookies & Analytics</strong><br />
            This website uses Vercel Analytics and a self-hosted instance of <strong
              >Rybbit</strong
            >
            (open-source, cookieless web analytics) for anonymized usage statistics.
            Rybbit runs on infrastructure I control and does not share data with third
            parties. Affiliate links (Amazon) are tracked via Vercel Analytics and
            Rybbit events when you click on them. No tracking cookies are used. Google
            Analytics is not used on this site. For details, see <a
              href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy"
              class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Vercel's privacy policy</a
            >
            and the <a
              href="https://www.rybbit.io/privacy"
              class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Rybbit privacy policy</a
            >.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>4. Contact via Email</strong><br />
            If you send me inquiries via email, your details from the email, including
            the contact details you provided, will be stored by me for the purpose
            of processing the inquiry and in case of follow-up questions. I will not
            share this information without your consent.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>5. Newsletter</strong><br />
            If you subscribe to the newsletter, your email address is stored with
            the email service <strong>Brevo</strong> (Sendinblue GmbH, Köpenicker
            Straße 126, 10179 Berlin, Germany), which processes it on my behalf as
            a data processor (Art. 28 GDPR). It is used only to send you the newsletter
            and the welcome emails and is kept until you unsubscribe. Legal basis
            is your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). You can unsubscribe at any time via
            the link in every email; your address is then removed from the list. For
            details, see <a
              href="https://www.brevo.com/legal/privacypolicy/"
              class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Brevo's privacy policy</a
            >.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>6. Amazon Associates Program</strong><br />
            As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. Links marked
            with * point to Amazon (Amazon Europe Core S.à r.l., 38 avenue John F.
            Kennedy, L-1855 Luxembourg). This site sets no Amazon cookies. When you
            follow such a link, Amazon may set cookies on its own site to attribute
            the purchase; that processing is governed by <a
              href="https://www.amazon.de/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=201909010"
              class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon's privacy notice</a
            >.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>7. Your Rights</strong><br />
            You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing,
            data portability and objection (Art. 15 to 21 GDPR), and to withdraw consent
            at any time with effect for the future. You also have the right to lodge
            a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority (Art. 77 GDPR),
            for example the Landesbeauftragte für Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit
            Nordrhein-Westfalen (LDI NRW). To exercise these rights, contact me at
            the address above.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </Container>
</PageLayout>
